{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1485204-could-i-get-some-people-to-look-over-a-draft-of-an-americana-supplement","id":1485204,"title":"Could I get some people to look over a draft of an \"Americana\" supplement?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-06-28T12:32:26-07:00","id":1485204,"title":"Could I get some people to look over a draft of an \"Americana\" supplement?","content":"I am currently working on an &quot;American Legends&quot; supplement for Scion, which will bring in figures like Babe Ruth, Florida Man, the Unknown Soldier, and the Headless Horseman into the world of Scion. I've put together a rough draft of sorts, containing about eight new characters, along with some Relics, Guides, etc. In order to help these characters fit into a larger number of campaigns, each character has at least two roles they can fill: for example, the Headless Horseman can either be an Adversary, or, if you somehow manage to find his head, a grudging Follower. <br /> <br /> At this point, the product is pretty rough. There's lots of &quot;do this later&quot; blanks, the dot ratings need to be reviewed, and a lot of the art, etc., is provisional. However, I feel like I have enough to gauge what the final product will look like, more or less.<br /> <br /> Could I get a couple people to look it over for me? I just want to get an idea of how I'm doing so far, and whether I might need to make course corrections before I get too much deeper into it. If you're interested, please reply below or PM me, and I'll share the link.<br /> <br /> Thanks everybody!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27195-brokenimage321","name":"brokenimage321","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-28T13:30:24-07:00","id":1485206,"title":"","content":"I\u2019m happy to take a look","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-28T14:50:55-07:00","id":1485211,"title":"","content":"Florida Man is actually brilliant, like he makes a scary amount of sense as a semi-independent Folk-Deity representing the idea of Florida that outsiders have.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8100-caedus","name":"Caedus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"300"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-28T15:01:37-07:00","id":1485213,"title":"","content":"By the number of deeds Florida man have, I guess he is the pantheon leader.<br /> <br /> Jokes apart, I think there is a need for The Man, the ultimate evil man behind the curtin.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">